39. REACTIVE POWER MANAGEMENT 
(1) All users shall endeavour to maintain the voltage at the interconnection point in the 
range specified in the Grid Code. 
(2) All generating stations shall be capable of supplying reactive power support so as to 
maintain power factor at the point of interconnection within the limits of 0.95 lagging to 
0.95 leading as per the CEA Connectivity Standard Regulations.

